Latin America, and Africa. It originally relied on a manual identity verification (IDV) process that was labor-intensive and time-consuming. To automate the IDV process, Sun Finance implemented Amazon Rekognition in 2019. Using this AWS service, Sun Finance has streamlined the application process, which improves access to financial services in traditionally underfinanced regions.","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/sun-finance-logo%401x.60fe80aa3aea27a802921ceed85614ba48b1c4e9.jpg","displayLocation":"Latvia","customerNameLower":"sun finance","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Financial Services","sortDate":"2024-10-25","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/sun-finance?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Sun Finance","publishedDate":"2024","enableShare":"1","headline":"Sun Finance Uses Amazon Rekognition to Combat Identity Fraud and Remove Customer Friction","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#rekognition","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Rekognition","description":"Amazon Rekognition","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:04+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:56+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#ai-ml","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"AI \u0026 ML","description":"AI \u0026 ML","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:30:52+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-07T13:55:54+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#cee","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Central \u0026 Eastern Europe","description":"Central \u0026 Eastern Europe","dateCreated":"2020-03-10T05:12:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:41+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#textract","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Textract","description":"Amazon Textract","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:47+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:33:04+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#emea