ng created specifically for the Directory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/health/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#sumadi-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"sumadi-case-study","dateCreated":"2022-04-23T05:59:58+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-04-23T06:01:28+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Educational technology company Sumadi delivers near-real-time exam supervision simply and cost effectively after migrating to AWS and was able to scale to support 50,000 concurrent users.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/sumadi-logo%401x.c6f48563b80ab49a35a50e0ed51a88540ff65958.png","displayLocation":"Netherlands","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Education","sortDate":"2022-04-22","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/sumadi-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2022","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Sumadi Scales from 2,000 to 50,000 Concurrent Users after Migrating to AWS","customer-name":"Sumadi"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42