:"2023-06-08T04:07:36+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Datamart es una empresa que se dedica al procesamiento de información y presta servicios a la industria financiera. Su principal negocio es ser un concentrador de data distintiva y poner esta data para que las empresas puedan identificar prospectos o hacer el proceso de evaluación crediticia de sus clientes. La compañía nasció en AWS, desafiando grandes actores de la industria financiera en Chile a digitalizar sus operaciones.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/datamart_logo%401x.4db9e4cc4c6c9afa62dedb589db34095347c39ea.png","displayLocation":"Chile","footerInfoText":"Fecha de publicación","industry":"Software e Internet","sortDate":"2020-01-01","enableShare":"1","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/es/solutions/case-studies/datamart/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","publishedDate":"2020","contentType":"Historia del cliente","customer-name":"Datamart","headline":"Datamart: servicios innovadores para la industria financiera con AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#location#americas","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Americas","description":"Americas","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:29+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#ai-ml","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"AI \u0026 ML","description":"AI \u0026 ML","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:30:52+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-07T13:55:54+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#containers","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Containers","description":"Containers","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:32+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-19T05:00:37+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#software-internet","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Software \u0026 Internet","description":"Software \u0026 Internet","dateCreated":"2020-06-25T04:08:24+0000","dateUpdate